    "message": "feat!: enable routerOptions.compile by default\n\nCompile the router trees with find-my-way's compiler mode by default,\nmaking route lookups 1.3x to 2x faster. Set `routerOptions.compile` to\n`false` to restore the previous tree walk.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `routerOptions.compile` now defaults to `true`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
